# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is the impact of device drift? {#what-is-the-impact-of-device-drift}"
msgstr "Apa dampak dari device drift? {#what-is-the-impact-of-device-drift}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The impact of device drift (hardware performance that degrades over time) depends on many factors, such as when calibrations were last run, the specific experiment performed, any TLS activities, and so on. If a particular workload is very sensitive to device parameters' error values, you can perform a real-time device parameter benchmarking by following [this tutorial](/tutorials/real-time-benchmarking-for-qubit-selection) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
msgstr "Dampak dari device drift (performa hardware yang menurun seiring waktu) bergantung pada banyak faktor, seperti kapan kalibrasi terakhir dijalankan, eksperimen spesifik yang dilakukan, aktivitas TLS apa pun, dan sebagainya. Jika suatu workload sangat sensitif terhadap nilai error parameter device, kamu bisa melakukan benchmarking parameter device secara real-time dengan mengikuti [tutorial ini](/tutorials/real-time-benchmarking-for-qubit-selection) di IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
